          <commentary>옳은 연결이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>대형 베어링 레이스 － 링압연(ring rolling)</choice_text>
          <commentary>옳은 연결이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
